cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Release Gates for Physical AI: A Unified Framework for Functional, Adversarial, Cyber, and Hardware Verification of Learned Robot Systems"
message: "If you use this framework or its evidence schema, please cite the preprint."
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-30"
license: MIT
license-url: "https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT"
abstract: >-
  A framework for composing functional, adversarial, cybersecurity and hardware
  verification of learned robot policies into a single release decision, with a
  fidelity-gating rule that permits a test to block a release only once its predictive
  validity against real outcomes has been measured.
keywords:
  - robotics
  - verification and validation
  - vision-language-action models
  - adversarial robustness
  - functional safety
